+    """Exclusive advisory lock on a sidecar ``<path>.lock`` (so it works for
+    files that don't exist yet). POSIX uses ``fcntl.flock``; Windows uses
+    ``msvcrt.locking``. Raises ``TimeoutError`` if not acquired in ``timeout``
